                                                                                
 Usage: xrpl-camp-1.5.1-linux-x64 [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...                   
                                                                                
 XRPL Camp — learn the XRP Ledger in one sitting.                               
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --version                       Show the installed version and exit          │
│ --dry-run                       Simulate every command in this run: no       │
│                                 network calls, no disk writes                │
│ --yes                 -y        Non-interactive: never wait for a keypress   │
│                                 (RESET still asks)                           │
│ --verbose                       Include technical detail with errors         │
│ --install-completion            Install completion for the current shell.    │
│ --show-completion               Show completion for the current shell, to    │
│                                 copy it or customize the installation.       │
│ --help                          Show this message and exit.                  │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
╭─ Commands ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ start           Guided flow through all 6 lessons.                           │
│ status          Show your training progress.                                 │
│ wallet          Create or display your Testnet wallet. 'create' writes a     │
│                 seed to disk.                                                │
│ fund            Fund your wallet via the Testnet faucet.                     │
│ send            Send a memo payment on the XRPL Testnet. Defaults to your    │
│                 own mailbox.                                                 │
│ read            Read entries back off the ledger: yours, somebody else's, or │
│                 one hash.                                                    │
│ try             Break it on purpose against the live network. Signs nothing, │
│                 costs nothing.                                               │
│ reserve         Mint an NFT, then burn it, and watch the owner reserve lock  │
│                 and come back.                                               │
│ verify          Verify a transaction you sent, on the XRPL Testnet.          │
│ certificate     Generate a completion certificate and proof pack (--format   │
│                 text adds a .txt keepsake).                                  │
│ reset           Wipe all XRPL Camp state (.xrpl-camp/ directory).            │
│ self-check      Diagnose your environment and your connection to the ledger. │
│ support-bundle  Write a diagnostic zip for bug reports. Attach it to your    │
│                 issue.                                                       │
│ proof           Proof pack commands.                                         │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

